sections.content:
A keyspace is similar to a database in relational systems.
Create keyspace:
```sql
CREATE KEYSPACE college WITH replication = {'class': 'SimpleStrategy', 'replication_factor': 3};
```
Create table:
```sql
USE college;
CREATE TABLE students (roll_no INT PRIMARY KEY, name TEXT, department TEXT, grade TEXT);
```

Steps: User submits HQL query; Driver receives query; Compiler parses query; Metastore provides metadata; Optimizer improves execution plan; Execution Engine runs tasks using Hadoop processing frameworks; results are returned to user.
Example:
```sql
CREATE TABLE students (roll_no INT, name STRING, department STRING);
SELECT * FROM students;
SELECT department, COUNT(*) FROM students GROUP BY department;
```

